      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几周前，我曾向以优秀新人\n桐生院葵训练员为首的\n几位训练员，请教一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "028f3a003edb82e74cd46d0ea155297b3b2416ebb28e8e78406d4e164a7eaa10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
